[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/fly-speed-modifier/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/fly-speed-modifier/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Fly Speed Modifier[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that temporarily adjusts Freecam and player flight speed while you hold a key and scroll the mouse wheel.
[h2]Features[/h2][list]
[*]Supports Freecam speed multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Supports normal and direct player flight speed multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Hold the adjustment key and scroll the mouse wheel to adjust the multiplier[/*]
[*]Supports a configurable minimum, maximum, default multiplier, and scroll step[/*]
[*]Supports optionally resetting the multiplier when adjustment starts[/*]
[*]Full Range mode raises the available maximum from [b]20x[/b] to [b]100x[/b][/*]
[*]The Default Speed range updates immediately when Minimum Speed or Maximum Speed changes[/*]
[*]If Default Speed falls outside the current minimum and maximum range, it is moved to the nearest valid boundary[/*]
[*]Uses non-linear mouse-wheel multiplier adjustment[/*]
[*]Supports Vanilla Creative Flight and [url=https://modrinth.com/mod/freecam]Freecam[/url][/*]
[*]Uses Left Alt as the default adjustment key[/*]
[/list][h2]Configuration[/h2][h3]Full Range[/h3][list]
[*]Disabled by default[/*]
[*]Disabled: maximum available speed is [b]20x[/b][/*]
[*]Enabled: maximum available speed is [b]100x[/b][/*]
[*]The Maximum Speed and Default Speed sliders update immediately when this option changes[/*]
[/list][h3]Minimum Speed[/h3]Sets the lowest allowed temporary speed multiplier.
[h3]Maximum Speed[/h3]Sets the highest allowed temporary speed multiplier within the range selected by Full Range.
[h3]Default Speed[/h3]Sets the multiplier used for the first adjustment and when Reset Before Adjustment is enabled.
Its available range is always limited to the current Minimum Speed and Maximum Speed values.
[h3]Reset Before Adjustment[/h3][list]
[*]Enabled: pressing the adjustment key resets the multiplier to Default Speed[/*]
[*]Disabled: pressing the adjustment key keeps the previous multiplier[/*]
[/list][h3]Multiplier Step[/h3]Controls how quickly the multiplier changes for each mouse-wheel unit.
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.1.2[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.2+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.150.0+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Mod Menu (Optional)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
